text Well, even though this at least proves I'm not a coward...
sound 5OD.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text I have yet to cleanse myself of my dishonor.
text That's some admirable spirit right there.
goto 2
label 1
if intF[302] == 1
	goto s2
fi
goto 2
label s2
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh? Could it be you were crying until morning?
