text @[Sunohara]
text A hostage situation.
sound 5OG.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text I mean, you see stuff like that all the time in manga and TV dramas, right?
sound 5OH.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Stuff like, "Don't move a muscle, or the kid gets it...!"
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH16"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH16.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 5OI.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text I'm going to do that with some of her stuff.
text @[Tomoya]
text So, what are you going to steal?
