text @[Sunohara]
text You don't want to see her shout and scream "Stop it...! Anything but the mustache...!"?
text ...You definitely won't be seeing that.
text @[Tomoya]
text We've already proved it time and time again, anyway.
sound 5OV.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Proved what?
text @[Tomoya]
text That she's really strong.
