text Though if you stop right now, I think you can at least leave with your pride intact.
sound 5P0.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text C-Cowardly... Come on, man. It was just a little joke, hahah!
text @[Tomoya]
text In that case, stop it. It's not funny.
sound 5P1.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Hahah... I thought so. I thought it was at least worth a laugh, though.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Sunohara gets back into his seat and lets himself fall flat on his desk, and remains motionless like that for a while.
text I guess it must have been a great shock, having finally proven that Tomoyo's stronger than him.
setvar intF[211] = 1
goto 5
